<title>ITALY: Rinascente seeks cap increase approval.</title>
<headline>Rinascente seeks cap increase approval.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian retailing group Rinascente's board is to ask shareholders to empower it to increase capital by up to 600 billion lire.</p>
<p>A statement by Rinascente said an extraordinary shareholders' meeting would be called to approve granting the proposed facility to the board. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
